  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When taking pictures with a camera locked in the world, nametags (when set to display) will rotate towards the player's location and show up reversed when the player is in front of the camera\nIt would be really nice to have nametags show up perfectly aligned to the player's camera no matter where it is in relation to where the player is located in the world.\nSimilarly it would be really nice to have a \"double picture\" mode where it would instantly create two screenshots, one with nametags and one without them. This would allow a player to not worry about showing/hiding nametags or figuring out who the other players on the picture were.",
